dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.01=You FOOL!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.02=You WILL PAY!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.03=FACE MY WRATH!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.04=CURSE YOU!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.05=I WILL NOT FALL!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.06=YOU CANNOT STOP ME!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.07=TREACHERY!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.08=YOU WILL REGRET THIS!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.09=You dare defy me? You will regret this!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.10=My magic will consume you!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.11=You cannot escape my wrath!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.12=Your defiance will be your undoing.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.13=I will not be defeated by such a… creature.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.14=You think you are strong? You are merely a nuisance.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.15=You insignificant… insect! You will witness true power!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.16=My magic will shatter your feeble defenses!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.17=The very ground will tremble under my fury!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.18=You cannot comprehend the depths of my despair!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.19=This is but a taste of my vengeance!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.angry.20=You will pay dearly for your arrogance!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.01=You are but a fleeting annoyance.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.02=Your efforts are futile, mere child's play.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.03=Witness the true power of a master!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.04=Such… pathetic resistance.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.05=You cannot hope to stand against me.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.06=My magic will crush you like a bug.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.07=You are nothing more than a pawn in my grand design.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.08=Your fate is sealed.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.09=This will be a swift and… merciful end.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.10=You are a mere speck of dust in the grand scheme of things.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.11=Your defiance amuses me.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.12=Such… predictable tactics.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.13=I tire of this charade.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.14=Prepare to meet your doom.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.15=You are merely delaying the inevitable.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.16=My power is absolute.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.17=You are but a shadow in the face of true might.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.18=Your arrogance is… amusing.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.19=This will be a lesson you will never forget.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.arrogant.20=I shall savor your demise.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.01=My experiments have unlocked powers beyond your comprehension!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.02=You witness the culmination of years of tireless research!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.03=This is but a glimpse of the true potential of magic!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.04=I, Theron, will rewrite the very fabric of reality!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.05=Remember the name Theron… it will be whispered in legends!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.06=They called me Theron the Nice once… how naive they were!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.07=My creations will surpass anything you could ever imagine!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.08=Witness the power of a true innovator!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.09=You are merely an obstacle… an insignificant hurdle.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.10=My genius will ultimately prevail!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.11=I have pushed the boundaries of magic further than any before me!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.12=You are witnessing history in the making!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.13=This power… it is intoxicating!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.14=I am a visionary… a pioneer!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.15=You cannot fathom the depths of my intellect!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.16=My experiments have unlocked secrets that will shake the very foundations of this world!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.17=I am a god amongst mortals!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.18=You are but a… fleeting distraction from my true work.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.19=The world will tremble before my creations!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.boast.20=They called me Theron the Nice… but kindness is for the weak.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.phase_08.01=NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.phase_08.02=You will never get me alive!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.phase_08.03=Tremble before my final form!!!!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.phase_08.04=ROOOOOOOOOAAAARRRRRR
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.01=You are… more resilient than I anticipated.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.02=Impressive… but ultimately futile.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.03=You have a certain… tenacity.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.04=This is becoming… interesting.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.05=You are a worthy adversary… for now.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.06=Your resolve is commendable… but misplaced.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.07=I must admit, you are proving to be a challenge.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.08=Your strength is… undeniable.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.09=You are a worthy opponent… but you will fall.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.10=This is more… entertaining than I expected.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.11=You are a worthy… distraction.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.12=Your defiance… amuses me.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.13=You have a certain… spirit.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.14=I must commend your… perseverance.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.15=You are… more formidable than I initially believed.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.16=Your resilience is… admirable.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.17=You are a worthy… opponent, but ultimately insignificant.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.18=This is… more challenging than I anticipated.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.19=You are… a worthy adversary… but you cannot prevail.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.realize.20=Your strength… intrigues me.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.01=You cannot defeat me! Not yet!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.02=This is merely a setback!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.03=My magic will mend my wounds!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.04=Face my minions!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.05=You will not escape my wrath!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.06=This is not over!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.07=I will return… stronger!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.08=My magic will prevail!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.09=You cannot stop me!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.10=This is merely a test!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.11=I will not be defeated!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.12=You will pay for this!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.13=My power is beyond your comprehension!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.14=I will rise again!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.15=This is not the end!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.16=You cannot escape your destiny!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.17=My magic will protect me!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.18=You are merely delaying the inevitable.
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.19=I will not be denied!
dialogue.kattersstructures.theron.retreat.20=This is just the beginning!
